sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Org admin
    participant I as Identity / Policy
    participant D as Verifier store
    participant C as Client
    participant G as Gateway
    A->>I: Create least-privilege grant
    I->>D: Store verifier / prefix / policy
    I-->>A: Show plaintext secret once
    A->>C: Deliver key securely
    C->>G: Invoke with Bearer key
    G->>I: Resolve trusted identity
    I-->>G: Current scopes + quota
    A->>I: Revoke / rotate grant
    I->>D: Versioned update + invalidate
    Note over A,G: All new admission, dispatch and result reads honor revocation bound; inference keys never become admin
